Placeholder fixture for the INPUT_EXCLUDE regression test in
tests/integration/scenarios/05-exclude-and-exclude-delete.sh. This
file exists in the source fixture so the mirror has a `.bak` entry
to consider; the scenario asserts the file is NOT uploaded to the
FTP home because INPUT_EXCLUDE=*.bak (translated to
`set mirror:exclude '.*\.bak'`) blocks it.

If this file is missing, scenario 05 becomes vacuous (closes #165):
the assertion `assert_absent local.bak` would pass trivially because
no local file named `local.bak` ever existed in the first place.
